  2280	  # PLAN-166 F3 (ADR-155-AMEND-1): conditional ownership from the DELIVERY
  2281	  # RECORD — never the ceremony alone, never file presence. A path
  2282	  # install_one EXISTS-skipped stays out of the baseline, so doctor, the
  2283	  # update-checker and uninstall never treat an adopter file as
  2284	  # framework-owned (r7/r13/r17).
  2285	  #
  2286	  # Ownership CONTINUITY on reruns (codex W1-ceremony round, P1): a rerun
  2287	  # over an already-installed target EXISTS-skips all three paths, so the
  2288	  # THIS-RUN flags are 0 — but the manifest rewrite below REPLACES the old
  2289	  # manifest. Without consulting the PRIOR manifest's records, a rerun
  2290	  # would silently drop framework ownership of SPEC/PROTOCOL/marker (and a
  2291	  # v1.3 SPEC would later misclassify as ADOPTER-FORK — it is absent from
