  2447	# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  2448	# PLAN-153 Wave B item B1 — persist the install-state.
  2449	# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  2450	# Writes $TARGET/.claude/.install-state.json (next to the ADR-155 baseline
  2451	# manifest): the ORIGINAL request — verbatim argv + every parsed flag + the
  2452	# RESOLVED placeholder map (CLI > env > deterministic default; empty values
  2453	# omitted) — plus the operation journal for THIS run.
  2454	#
  2455	#   * Atomic: python writes a same-directory tempfile, then os.replace().
  2456	#   * Updated on every run: first_recorded_at + run_count + a bounded
  2457	#     history (last 20 runs) survive re-installs; request/operations
  2458	#     reflect the LATEST run.
  2459	#   * Schema-versioned: schema ceo.install-state/v1, schema_version 1.
  2460	#   * Consumed by upgrade.sh (PLAN-153 B2): request.profile/request.stack
  2461	#     become upgrade DEFAULTS when its own flags are omitted. A missing or
