  1335	  # Falls through to the legacy whole-tree path for FILE targets or when no
  1336	  # manifest is present (fail-open to today's behavior). The whole-tree backup
  1337	  # below still runs first so $BAK_DIR holds the pre-upgrade tree for rollback.
