  1347	  fi
  1348	
  1349	  # PLAN-138 Wave C (ADR-155): single-FILE target with a baseline loaded —
  1350	  # classify it too (e.g. .claude/task-chains.yaml, .claude/team.md). Preserve
  1351	  # an ADOPTER-CUSTOMIZED file / refuse a CONFLICT instead of clobbering.
